  "summary": "Malicious code in vl-ui-content-header (npm)",
  "details": "Vl-ui-content-header@1.0.0 is a combosquat placeholder that impersonates the vl-ui-* UI library namespace. The package contains no functional code: index.js holds only a comment line and the preinstall/postinstall lifecycle scripts are empty. It ships no dependencies, no binaries, and performs no network activity. The package is an inert name-squatting placeholder with no executable payload.",
